  "slides": [
    {
      "kind": "cover",
      "quote": {
        "text": "My finances are scattered across too many apps",
        "source": "searchedProblems[0].phrase"
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "scattered"
      ],
      "promise": {
        "text": "How to organize your finances when everything is scattered",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/title"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "In short",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Bank apps, statements, a notes file and a lot in your head: a ten minute starting page you can fill in from memory, with the gaps marked.",
          "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/dek#0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Minutes 0 to 2",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[0].when"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "List where your money information lives: bank apps, a statements folder, notes, a spreadsheet, a drawer, your head.",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[0].what#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Don't open any of them yet.",
          "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[0].what#1"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "information"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Minutes 2 to 6",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[1].when"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Fill in the six areas from memory.",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[1].what#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Round numbers are fine.",
          "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[1].what#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Write a question mark next to anything you'd be guessing.",
          "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[1].what#2"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "memory"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Minute 7",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[2].when"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Circle the number you most want: either what's free to spend, or when a debt ends.",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[2].what#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "That decides which question mark you chase first.",
          "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[2].what#1"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "Circle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Minutes 7 to 9",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[3].when"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Close one gap.",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[3].what#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "A good first one is a bill with no due date, since a missed date is what costs a fee.",
          "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[3].what#1"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "Close"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Minute 10",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[4].when"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Pick a day to look at the page again: weekly if you're catching up, monthly once things are steady.",
        "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[4].what#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Put it in your calendar, with the page's location.",
          "source": "guide:organize-your-finances-from-scratch/body[3].steps[4].what#1"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "catching"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "help",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "How it helps",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "name": {
        "text": "Personal Finance Companion",
        "source": "title"
      },
      "line": {
        "text": "One place holding accounts, income, bills, subscriptions, transactions, debt and savings, with a single figure for what is actually available.",
